FreeFCC / SkylabFCCfree — AGPL-3.0
    The DUML payloads in app/src/main/assets/profiles/fcc.json (and the reference
    asset ce_restore.json), the 0x51:0x1A wlm_service_mode_switch_req 4G frame,
    and the 00:51 serial-query approach are derived from these projects.

lmdegreeds/dji_gpsoff
    The floating-overlay WINDOW mechanism in OverlayService.kt
    (TYPE_APPLICATION_OVERLAY + FLAG_NOT_FOCUSABLE, the draggable handle, the
    tap-vs-drag gesture) is adapted from this project. Its DUML code, which
    addresses parameters by index, is NOT used — all parameter addressing here is
    by name-hash.

